# Eventbrite Event Planning Tips

## Overview
This document contains event planning tips and resources collected from Eventbrite's Help Center.

## Organizing an Event
- [Create and edit ticket types](https://www.eventbrite.com/help/en-us/articles/644100/how-to-create-custom-ticket-types/)
- [Add images and video to your event](https://www.eventbrite.com/help/en-us/articles/682424/how-to-choose-a-great-event-image/)

## Creating an Event
- [Creating an event](https://help.eventbrite.com/topics/creating-an-event/)

## Marketing an Event
- [Marketing an event](https://help.eventbrite.com/topics/marketing-an-event/)

## Managing Orders
- [Managing orders](https://help.eventbrite.com/topics/managing-orders/)
- [Email your registered attendees](https://www.eventbrite.com/help/en-us/articles/484221/how-to-email-your-attendees-through-eventbrite/)
- [Issue a full or partial refund](https://www.eventbrite.com/help/en-us/articles/158301/how-to-refund-an-order/)

## Payout Methods
- [Add and manage your payout methods](https://www.eventbrite.com/help/en-us/articles/207077/add-and-manage-your-payout-methods/)
- [Troubleshoot delayed or missing payouts](https://www.eventbrite.com/help/en-us/articles/613631/delayed-or-missing-payouts/)



